{"ID":"20240522082308-3nn4gw5","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082308-3nn4gw5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082308-3nn4gw5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082308-c0fuejz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522083917-kqvu00o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2600,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522083915-xk72wzq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:24,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:24\u0026#125;","title":"慢性肝病","type":"doc","updated":"20240522084048"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522082308-c0fuejz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522082308-c0fuejz","updated":"20240522083904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝病醫案一則（網診）："}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-gkncgrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-gkncgrs","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2008-02-25 初診"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-6ja2xdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-6ja2xdm","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基本資料：男，59歲，75KG，身高178CM。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-3mxvtd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-3mxvtd0","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"來診原因：脅下疼，右腳跟疼，易感冒。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-u3kbbop","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-u3kbbop","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"發病經過：約在2002年查出乙肝小三陽，伴口苦，困倦，消化不好，吃過一些多酶片等促進消化的藥。近來身體開始比較不適。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-bgcr4md","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-bgcr4md","updated":"20240522084008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"問診:"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-gdbatgc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-gdbatgc","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、睡眠不好，晚10時入睡，半夜3點左右要醒一次，長期如此。早上有時要睡到8、9點才起床。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-wqwm2hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-wqwm2hn","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、食欲尚可，喜甜食。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-r0qbeiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-r0qbeiy","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、大便一日2次，早晚各一次。（以前一天數次大便）"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-jx04r2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-jx04r2r","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、小便一天3-4次，中黃。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-m8ksi68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-m8ksi68","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、不渴，但主動喝水多。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-tnmczli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-tnmczli","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、手腳熱，尤其到晚上手腳會非常熱。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-o9ei1rv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-o9ei1rv","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、少汗，以前幾乎不出汗，現在情況稍好轉，幹點活還能出點汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-51c3t6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-51c3t6b","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、體力差，中午12點後會比較困。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-nhsu4vi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-nhsu4vi","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、左右脅下疼，大概是從下往上數第2、3根肋骨的地方，很疼。胃的部位難受，胸腔感覺很憋悶，右腳跟疼痛，走路都跛著走，膝蓋也疼。晨起口苦。平時易感冒，後背一受涼就快感冒了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-5urf9gf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-5urf9gf","updated":"20240522084011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診:"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"92/分鐘，浮。（患者的兒子所摸的脈，供參考）。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-fkm57gu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-fkm57gu","updated":"20240522084012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"處方:"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少陽少陰合病，舒肝利膽，補腎。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-iy93lyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-iy93lyd","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡15   xx15   黃芩9   龍膽草6  法半夏9 黨參15   生薑3片  枳實6   厚樸6    天花粉6  丹皮9    補骨脂15 山藥15  川芎6    xx9"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-n5la0f2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-n5la0f2","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6碗水煮成2碗，去渣，早晚各溫服一碗，5付。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-l1u74xl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-l1u74xl","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2008-3-7 二診"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-yyc0blp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-yyc0blp","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"兩脅疼痛、口苦現象大大減輕，但右腳跟還疼"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-9zwpsct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-9zwpsct","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、睡眠好多了，偶爾還會半夜醒。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-on4u4u2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-on4u4u2","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、食欲比較強烈。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-vt4ngzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-vt4ngzp","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、手腳熱甚的情況有改善，未服藥前大約10天有8天會手腳熱，服藥後10天只有1、2天手腳熱。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-vmleicl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-vmleicl","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、精神較之前好多了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-aelni27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-aelni27","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、大小便等情況沒變化。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-0ejdzh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-0ejdzh6","updated":"20240522084031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"處方:"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-ua8c75m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-ua8c75m","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡10   xx10   黃芩10  龍膽草10   法半夏12  黨參15   生薑3片  枳實6   厚樸6   天花粉6  丹皮9    補骨脂15 山藥15  川芎6"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-l77ajvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-l77ajvu","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"xx9    牛膝10   xx15   肉桂粉9(沖服)"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-jhghp4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-jhghp4z","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7碗水(1400ml)煮成3碗(600ml)，去渣，早中晚各溫服一碗，每碗沖入肉桂粉3克,3付。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-8g5zsx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-8g5zsx4","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2008-03-14 三診"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-a03b1d1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-a03b1d1","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"兩脅疼痛的現象已無。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-kju05ur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-kju05ur","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、睡眠好多了，一覺到天亮（早上7點）"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-63icgs5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-63icgs5","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、食欲略減"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-wxdq5ku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-wxdq5ku","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、大便不變，小便一天5-6次，顔色比之前稍淺。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-5wyznc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-5wyznc0","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、手腳發熱的情況很少出現，偶爾有一次。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-p5arxlg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-p5arxlg","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、春天來了，在地裏幹活，汗會出得較多。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-929o78g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-929o78g","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、精神更好些。原來臉上就像蒙了一層泥垢，黃中帶黑，現象臉上亮多了。（患者兒子回家觀察的感覺）"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-4uc0n6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-4uc0n6q","updated":"20240522084033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"處方:"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-begmwho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-begmwho","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡10  xx10  黃芩10  龍膽草10 法半夏12  黨參15  生薑3片 天花粉6  丹皮9  補骨脂15  川芎6   xx9  牛膝10   xx15  茯苓15"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-3x43j7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-3x43j7u","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"車前子10 肉桂粉6（沖服）"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-4vhnho7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-4vhnho7","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7碗水煮成3碗，分溫三服。3付。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-alfnlcx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-alfnlcx","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"另加服六味地黃丸（治其足跟痛）"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-h4ls2lc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-h4ls2lc","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2008-3-20 四診"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-71z6oli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-71z6oli","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、睡眠好。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-29dsgnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-29dsgnr","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、食欲好轉，飯量增加。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-1kn5zhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-1kn5zhu","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、大便一日2次，稀溏。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-s2hvix7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-s2hvix7","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、小便顔色較黃。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-2elhn1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-2elhn1v","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、覺得渴，喝水很多。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-rohabqy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-rohabqy","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、出汗較多。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-z0e8bht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-z0e8bht","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以前一變天就要感冒，困倦，最近幾天下小雨，溫度降了，也沒有感冒。兩脅在幹活較多時還會覺得疼，位置相對靠上一點。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-hkz2kpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-hkz2kpn","updated":"20240522084035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"處方:"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-fl9ayh5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-fl9ayh5","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前方去掉牛膝和肉桂，服五付。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-5b41k2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-5b41k2i","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"經詢問，患者怕六味地黃丸跟湯藥有衝突，所以沒有吃。經解釋後才開始服用。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-hrc6o6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-hrc6o6p","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2008-3-28 五診"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-k7htymw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-k7htymw","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、精神更好，足跟痛的情況稍有改善，但不太明顯。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-mrj3dm2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-mrj3dm2","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、飯量更大了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-nabif9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-nabif9b","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、大便一日2至3次，稀溏。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-0r9r87k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-0r9r87k","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、小便顔色仍然較黃，一天4-5次。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-bzv3f56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-bzv3f56","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、感覺很渴，喝水很多。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-61lipoq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-61lipoq","updated":"20240522084037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"處方:"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-3h0w055","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-3h0w055","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡10  黃芩10  xx15  龍膽草10  法半夏12  黨參15  生薑3片 天花粉30  丹皮9  補骨脂10  川芎9  xx9  xx15  茯苓15  車前子10"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-c3rp364","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-c3rp364","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7碗煮成3碗，分溫三服，5 付。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-3744cdq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-3744cdq","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2008-4-9 六診"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-s4bjbtz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-s4bjbtz","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"從下往上數第5、6肋骨處有一點點痛，足根疼有緩解，走路多、幹活多時還會疼。偶爾還會覺得口苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-ev3fwyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-ev3fwyt","updated":"20240522084044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"處方:"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"痛的位置在肝經“期門穴”。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-4ykeves","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-4ykeves","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡10 xx15  黃芩10  龍膽草6  法半夏12  黨參10 生薑3片川芎6  xx9  xx10  xxx10  丹參15  當歸10 生地15"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-jazh5uj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-jazh5uj","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7碗煮成3碗，3付。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-xk72wzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-xk72wzq","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2008-04-26 七診"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-jsvfmp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-jsvfmp8","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基本情況都很好，就是足跟痛沒有改善，仍然痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-awbif6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-awbif6n","updated":"20240522084048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"外浸方："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加味麻杏薏甘湯"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-vqjqn7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-vqjqn7h","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃6 炙甘草12  薏仁6  杏仁20  川芎10   當歸6 勾藤6   丹皮6"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-tpchqfq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-tpchqfq","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浸泡足跟，每日一至兩次。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-vy1fo64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-vy1fo64","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2008-5-9"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-svbs6mb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-svbs6mb","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"足跟痛改善很多，還有一點痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-h9ojr5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-h9ojr5c","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叫他可以繼續泡腳，自行根據情況停止。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083923-ur5biuh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083923-ur5biuh"}},{"ID":"20240522083915-8rsi8vc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-8rsi8vc","updated":"20240522083920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語:"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這位同學目前仍就讀於廣州中醫藥大學，所以我不公佈他的名字，以免遭受校方的刁難，讀者光是看這案例就可以知道，未來又將有一位優秀的經方家出現，其正確的思考模式，出方的準確性，用藥的劑量，都讓老師有驚艷之感，好好加油吧，將來必也是一方之名醫。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083915-06ctdua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083915-06ctdua","updated":"20240522083915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於台北07/21/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522083917-kqvu00o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083917-kqvu00o"}}]}